.fm-relay{--fm-green:#0f5a2c;--fm-green-soft:#e3efe6;--fm-bronze:#a8773c;--fm-bronze-soft:#f4e9da;--fm-fg:#1e2a22;--fm-muted:#5f6a63;--fm-line:#dedad1;
  color:var(--fm-fg);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 0 24px}
.fm-relay *{box-sizing:border-box}
.fm-relay .fm-kicker{color:var(--fm-bronze);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 6px}
.fm-relay h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px}
.fm-relay h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 12px}
.fm-relay p{margin:0 0 12px}
.fm-relay .fm-lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--fm-fg)}
.fm-relay .fm-muted{color:var(--fm-muted)}
.fm-relay .fm-sec{margin-top:36px}
.fm-relay .fm-now{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:18px 0 4px}
.fm-relay .fm-pill{border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--fm-green-soft);color:var(--fm-green);font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
.fm-relay .fm-pill.b{background:var(--fm-bronze-soft);color:var(--fm-bronze)}
.fm-relay .fm-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:12px;counter-reset:fm}
.fm-relay .fm-steps li{counter-increment:fm;position:relative;padding:14px 16px 14px 62px;border:1px solid var(--fm-line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff}
.fm-relay .fm-steps li::before{content:counter(fm);position:absolute;left:16px;top:14px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--fm-green);color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.fm-relay .fm-steps strong{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.fm-relay .fm-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
@media (max-width:640px){.fm-relay .fm-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.fm-relay .fm-card{border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;background:var(--fm-green-soft)}
.fm-relay .fm-card.b{background:var(--fm-bronze-soft)}
.fm-relay .fm-card p:last-child{margin:0}
.fm-relay ul.fm-list{margin:0;padding-left:20px}
.fm-relay ul.fm-list li{margin-bottom:6px}
.fm-relay details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--fm-line);padding:12px 0}
.fm-relay summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;list-style:none}
.fm-relay summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.fm-relay summary::after{content:"+";float:right;color:var(--fm-bronze);font-size:20px;line-height:1}
.fm-relay details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}
.fm-relay details p{margin:8px 0 0}
.fm-relay .fm-cta{margin-top:36px;border-radius:20px;padding:24px;background:var(--fm-green);color:#fff;text-align:center}
.fm-relay .fm-cta h3{color:#fff}
.fm-relay .fm-cta p{color:#e3efe6}
.fm-relay .fm-btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:var(--fm-green);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
.fm-relay .fm-track{margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 20px;border:2px solid var(--fm-green);border-radius:18px;padding:16px 18px}
.fm-relay .fm-track p{margin:0}
.fm-relay .fm-track strong{display:block;font-size:17px}
.fm-relay .fm-btn.g{background:var(--fm-green);color:#fff;margin:0}
.fm-relay .fm-btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center}
.fm-relay .fm-tag{font-weight:700;color:var(--fm-bronze)}
</style>

<div class="fm-relay">
  <p class="fm-kicker">Mold relay · #ФормікаМандрує</p>
  <h2>One mold, eight makers, one city</h2>
  <p class="fm-lead">#ФормікаМандрує (“Formika travels”) is a relay in which one Formika silicone mold passes from hand to hand between epoxy resin makers in one Ukrainian city. Each maker casts her own piece in it and then hands the mold to the next one — in person.</p>
  <p class="fm-muted">Eight people, eight different colours and characters in the very same mold — and a chance to meet other resin lovers nearby 🌿</p>
  <div class="fm-now">
    <span class="fm-pill">First city — Kharkiv</span>
    <span class="fm-pill b">Starts 1 December 2026</span>
  </div>
  <div class="fm-track">
    <p><strong>Where is the mold now? 🚃</strong><span class="fm-muted">Route map: who has already cast, who has the mold now and who is next.</span></p>
    <a class="fm-btn g" href="https://claude.ai/artifact/KvkHTPpuy5Ck8u9yASTjCt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Track the route</a>
  </div>

  <div class="fm-sec">
    <h3>How it works</h3>
    <ol class="fm-steps">
      <li><strong>Sign up in the comments</strong>Comment under the announcement post on Instagram @formika.store. The order of comments is the queue. Sign-up is open for one week.</li>
      <li><strong>The mold comes to you</strong>I send the mold to the first participant; after that, each maker gets it in person from the previous one, in our branded case.</li>
      <li><strong>Your pour</strong>You have 7–10 days with the mold. Post your result with <span class="fm-tag">#ФормікаМандрує</span> and tag Formika.</li>
      <li><strong>Pass it on</strong>Meet the next maker and hand the mold over, then note it under the post so everyone can see where the mold is.</li>
      <li><strong>Prize draw</strong>When the round is over, a random draw picks the winner. No votes or likes — everyone has the same chance.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="fm-sec fm-grid">
    <div class="fm-card">
      <h3>The travelling mold</h3>
      <p>A 15×15 cm lamp mold with organic uneven edges. It travels in a protective transformer case.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fm-card b">
      <h3>The prize</h3>
      <p>The same mold, brand new 🎁</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fm-sec">
    <h3>An honest test</h3>
    <p>After eight pours the mold comes back to me, and I'll show how it looks after the whole relay — surface, edges, details. The best proof of how our molds handle real work by different hands and different resins.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="fm-cta">
    <h3>Follow the journey</h3>
    <p>Announcements, the queue and participants' pieces are on Formika's Instagram.</p>
    <div class="fm-btns">
      <a class="fm-btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/formika.store/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go to Instagram</a>
      <a class="fm-btn" href="https://claude.ai/artifact/KvkHTPpuy5Ck8u9yASTjCt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mold route</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
`;var s=document.currentScript;var d=document.createElement('div');d.innerHTML=fmRelayHTML;if(s&&s.parentNode){s.parentNode.insertBefore(d,s);}else{document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){var c=document.querySelector('.script-plugin');(c||document.body).appendChild(d);});}})();
